      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"chunkSize\" and \"frameSize\" are still absent from both hashCode and equals here. OSGiNorthbound.modified restarts the endpoint only when the configuration compares unequal, so http1-chunk-size and http2-max-frame-size are silently ignored on a live reconfiguration while the four limits added here now apply. Since you are already editing both methods, could we add those two as well?",
