      "writtenOn": "2026-09-21T13:48:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These four Uint32 values are only range-checked in NettyEndpointConfiguration. A direct user of this exported class can pass a Uint32 above Integer.MAX_VALUE. intValue() then wraps negative and every inbound connection dies inside handlerAdded when HTTPScheme builds the codec. Could we check 1..Integer.MAX_VALUE here so the failure lands at construction time instead of per connection?",
